   "rule": "XAUUSD, 1h bars on UTC hours (mid prices). After every 1h bar close, if the sleeve is flat: H = highest mid-high and L = lowest mid-low of the last 24 bars (the bar just closed included), W = H - L, Wref = median of W over the previous 480 bars (at least 240 values). If W <= 0.7 x Wref, place an OCO pair valid until the next 1h bar closes: buy-stop at H (triggers on ask), sell-stop at L (triggers on bid); the first touched is the trade, the other is cancelled. Stop-loss 2 x ATR14(1h, Wilder, value at the decision bar) from the fill price; trailing stop at the same distance from the best bid-high (long) / ask-low (short) since entry, updated at each M1 close; time stop 5 New-York trading days after the decision bar close minus 5 minutes (last bar before a closure). One position at a time; fixed % risk per trade.",
